msgid "**稳定版本**：按照项目版本节奏发布，并非每个上游 Triton 版本都会有对应的稳定发布"
msgstr "**Stable Version**: Released in accordance with the project version cadence; not every upstream Triton version will have a corresponding stable release."

msgid "**rc 版本**：与上游 Triton 版本节奏同步发布，供用户早期测试"
msgstr "**rc version**: Released in sync with the upstream Triton version cadence for early user testing."

msgid "**post 版本**：根据需要发布，用于修复现有稳定版本中的问题"
msgstr "**Post Version**: Released as needed to fix issues in the current stable version."

